# Wireframe: ProjectList

## Purpose & Flow Context

Displays a paginated list of projects for the selected team with filtering and infinite scroll capabilities. Serves as the main view when navigating to /projects route. Entry: from sidebar navigation or direct URL. Exit: to project detail view or by applying filters.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px / 4px rhythm intent.

**App-shell**: Shared header + nav + container. Regions:

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Header | Logo, workspace switcher, notifications, user menu | Fixed height, sticky |
| Nav | Sidebar navigation (collapsible) | Collapsed to icons on mobile |
| Main | ProjectList content | Takes remaining space |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Status filter controls (top of list)
2. Project list cards (scrollable area)
3. Loading spinner / error message / empty state (centered when applicable)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Header: Logo / WorkspaceSwitcher / [Notifications] / [UserMenu] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +-----------------------------+  +-----------------------------+  |
|  |  Nav: [Dashboard] [Projects]>|  |  Main:                    |  |
|  |  [Issues] [Calendar] [Docs] |  |                           |  |
|  |                             |  |                           |  |
|  |                             |  |                           |  |
|  |  [>Filter▼]                 |  |  [Projects List Area]       |  |
|  |                             |  |  [ProjectCard]              |  |
|  |                             |  |  [ProjectCard]              |  |
|  |                             |  |  [ProjectCard]              |  |
|  |                             |  |  ...                        |  |
|  |                             |  |                             |  |
|  +-----------------------------+  +-----------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Footer (if applicable)                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| `[>Filter▼]` | StatusFilter | Dropdown shows status options: All, Planned, In Progress, Completed, Canceled | Truncates long status names, scrollable options if many |
| `[Projects List Area]` | ProjectList container | Scrollable div with virtual scrolling for performance | Handles 1000s of items efficiently |
| `[ProjectCard]` | ProjectCard | Shows project name, status badge, metadata (issue count, due date); clicks navigate to project detail | Long project names truncate with tooltip, status icons for colorblind users |
| `[+ New Project]` | TBD — Button (pending DS definition) | Opens project creation modal (out of scope for this change) | Hidden if user lacks permissions |

## Data Display

List vs cards rationale: Cards chosen for better visual hierarchy and touch targets on mobile. Each card displays:
- Project name (heading)
- Status badge with text and icon
- Metadata line (issue count, due date)
- Avatar icons for recent contributors (if any)

Progressive disclosure: Metadata initially shows issue count; on hover reveals due date and last updated.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| `[>Filter▼]` | "Filter projects by status" | Communicates the filtering capability clearly |
| Project name (in card) | Project identifier | Matches backend data model, no truncation of meaning |
| Status badge | Current project state | Uses past-tense verbs: "In Progress", "Completed" |
| Metadata line | Project activity summary | "5 issues • Due Jul 30" format |
| Empty state heading | "No projects found" | Clear, actionable message |
| Empty state button (filtered-to-zero) | "Adjust filters" | Guides user to clear or change filter |
| Empty state button (first-run) | "Create your first project" | Guides user to project creation when team has zero projects |
| Loading spinner label | "Loading projects..." | Polite, ongoing process indication |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Shows a list of ProjectCard components in a scrollable container. Status filter defaults to "All". List shows 20 items initially (per limit default), with infinite scroll loading more as user reaches bottom.

### Empty

Two distinct scenarios:

**Filtered-to-zero:** User applied a status filter that matches no projects.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                     [📭]                                          |
|                     No projects match this filter                  |
|                     [Adjust filters]                               |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

**First-run:** Team has no projects yet.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                     [📭]                                          |
|                     No projects yet                                |
|                     [Create your first project]                    |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Loading

Shown during initial fetch or refetch when changing filters or pagination.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [===== skeleton bar =====]   [==== skeleton ===]               |
|  [==== skeleton bar =====]                                       |
|  [==== skeleton bar =====]   [==== skeleton ===]               |
|  [==== skeleton bar =====]                                       |
|  [==== skeleton bar =====]   [==== skeleton ===]               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Error

Shown when API returns 400 (validation) or 401 (unauthorized) or network error.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [⚠] Failed to load projects                                     |
|  Invalid team ID                                                 |
|  [Retry]                                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Success / Confirmation

Not applicable for read-only list view. Success is implicit in populated state.

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full layout as described: collapsed nav sidebar, main content area |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Nav collapses to hamburger menu, main content takes full width |
| Mobile (<768px) | Nav hidden behind hamburger icon, header shows [Menu] logo [Workspace] [Search], cards stack vertically with full-width touch targets |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | header: workspace branding and actions; nav: sidebar navigation; main: project list region |
| Heading order | h1: "Projects" (if needed); h2: section titles within cards if any |
| Reading / Focus order | 1. Status filter (if visible) 2. First project card 3. Tab through cards 4. Load more area (if visible) |
| Accessible names | Status filter dropdown gets `aria-label="Filter projects by status"` |
| Keyboard operability | Tab navigates filter → cards → load more indicator; Enter on card navigates to detail; Escape closes filters |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation on filter dropdown, project cards, retry buttons |
| Focus not obscured | Sticky header doesn't obscure focused element when scrolling |
| Non-color intent | Status badges use icon + text (○ for planned, ● for in_progress, ✓ for completed, ✗ for canceled) |

*Defer to design-system: pixel contrast, focus-appearance, per-component target-size/keyboard.*